---
title: SUAVE battery monitoring and adaptation (suave_bt_extended manager)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BM as battery_monitor<br/>(suave_monitor)
    participant MAV as MAVROS
    participant AP as ArduSub SITL
    participant DIAG as /diagnostics<br/>(topic)
    participant BT as suave_bt_extended manager<br/>(BatteryLevel, ChangeMode,<br/>RechargeBattery)
    participant SM as system_modes<br/>(f_generate_search_path,<br/>f_follow_pipeline,<br/>generate_recharge_path)
    participant RB as generate_recharge_path_node<br/>(RechargeBattery LC)
    participant MET as mission_metrics

    Note over BM: battery_level = 1.0, discharge_time = 200 s
    MAV->>BM: mavros/state (mode == GUIDED)
    BM->>BM: start qa_publishing_period (1 s) timer, unsubscribe from state

    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
    Note over BM,MET: Battery drains and low battery is detected
    loop every qa_publishing_period
        BM->>BM: battery_level -= dt / discharge_time (clamped at 0)
        BM->>DIAG: DiagnosticStatus OK, "QA status"<br/>battery_level = (current value)
        par
            DIAG->>BT: BatteryLevel::diagnostics_cb<br/>battery_level_ = value
        and
            DIAG->>MET: check_battery()
        end
    end
    MET->>MET: battery_level < battery_limit (0.25)<br/>record battery_low_time
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
    Note over BT,MET: Manager adapts: switch to recharge
    BT->>BT: tick: battery_level(threshold 0.25) → FAILURE<br/>halt search_pipeline / inspect_pipeline
    BT->>SM: ChangeMode(f_generate_search_path, fd_unground)
    BT->>SM: ChangeMode(f_follow_pipeline, fd_unground)
    BT->>SM: ChangeMode(generate_recharge_path, normal)
    SM->>RB: lifecycle transition → active
    RB->>MET: /generate_recharge_path_node/transition_event (active)
    MET->>MET: log battery drop reaction time
    BT->>RB: get_state (verify ACTIVE)
    RB-->>BT: PRIMARY_STATE_ACTIVE → ChangeMode SUCCESS
    end

    rect rgb(230, 245, 230)
    Note over BM,RB: Vehicle goes to the station and recharges
    alt use_action_server = false (legacy)
        RB->>RB: on_activate() spawns recharge task
        BT->>BT: recharge onLegacyStart → RUNNING<br/>(waits for recharge/complete)
    else use_action_server = true
        BT->>RB: RechargeBattery goal (/recharge_battery)
        RB-->>BT: goal accepted (single-flight guard)
    end
    loop every 1 / recharge_retry_rate (0.5 s) until at station
        RB->>MAV: /mavros/setpoint_position/local<br/>(station x, y, z = ground_depth + altitude)
        MAV->>AP: SET_POSITION_TARGET → vehicle moves
        MAV-->>RB: /mavros/local_position/pose
        RB->>RB: is_xy_setpoint_reached(tolerance 0.5 m)?
    end
    RB->>BM: Trigger battery_monitor/recharge
    BM->>BM: battery_level = 1.0
    BM->>DIAG: DiagnosticStatus OK, "QA status"<br/>battery_level = 1.0
    par
        DIAG->>BT: BatteryLevel::diagnostics_cb<br/>battery_level_ = 1.0
    and
        DIAG->>MET: check_battery(): battery_low = false
    end
    BM->>BT: /battery_monitor/recharge/complete (true)<br/>(only read by the legacy BT node)
    BM-->>RB: Trigger response success = true
    alt use_action_server = false (legacy)
        BT->>BT: recharge onLegacyRunning → SUCCESS
    else use_action_server = true
        RB-->>BT: result success = true (succeed)
    end
    end

    rect rgb(225, 235, 250)
    Note over BT,RB: Return to the mission
    BT->>SM: ChangeMode(generate_recharge_path, inactive)
    SM->>RB: lifecycle transition → inactive
    BT->>RB: get_state (verify INACTIVE)
    RB-->>BT: PRIMARY_STATE_INACTIVE
    BT->>BT: next tick: battery_level → SUCCESS<br/>resume the interrupted search or inspect step
    BT->>SM: ChangeMode(f_generate_search_path, fd_spiral_*)<br/>or ChangeMode(f_follow_pipeline, fd_follow_pipeline)
    Note over BT: Battery keeps draining from 1.0, so the next drop below<br/>0.25 comes about 150 s after each recharge.
    end
